### 9. **CoursesController.cs — Extension Check Case Sensitivity Mutation**
- **Location:** `/tmp/sv-7d20495e5cc14dd5b458b7c2af80c8a5/ContosoUniversity/Controllers/CoursesController.cs`, lines 69, 138
- **Mutation:** `.ToLower()` removed from fileExtension
